[5.775455, "o", "Help on module hvac_simulator:\r\n\r\nN\bNA\bAM\bME\bE\r\n    hvac_simulator - HVAC Room Thermal Simulator\r\n\r\nD\bDE\bES\bSC\bCR\bRI\bIP\bPT\bTI\bIO\bON\bN\r\n    Simulates a first-order thermal system for a server room with:\r\n"]
[5.775519, "o", "    - Unknown process gain (K) and time constant (tau) - must be identified!\r\n    - Heater input (0-100% power)\r\n    - Gaussian measurement noise\r\n    - Safety limits\r\n\r\n    The thermal dynamics follow:\r\n        dT/dt = (1/tau) * (K * u + T_ambient - T)\r\n\r\n    Where:\r\n        T = current room temperature (C)\r\n        u = heater power (0-100%)\r\n"]
[5.775737, "o", "        K = process gain (C per % power at steady state)\r\n        tau = time constant (seconds)\r\n        T_ambient = ambient/outdoor temperature (C)\r\n\r\nC\bCL\bLA\bAS\bSS\bSE\bES\bS\r\n    builtins.object\r\n        HVACSimulator\r\n\r\n"]
[5.77581, "o", "    class H\bHV\bVA\bAC\bCS\bSi\bim\bmu\bul\bla\bat\bto\bor\br(builtins.object)\r\n     |  HVACSimulator(config_path: str = '/root/room_config.json')\r\n     |\r\n     |  First-order thermal system simulator for HVAC control.\r\n     |\r\n     |  Methods defined here:\r\n     |\r\n     |  _\b__\b_i\bin\bni\bit\bt_\b__\b_(self, config_path: str = '/root/room_config.json')\r\n     |      Initialize the simulator with parameters from config file.\r\n     |\r\n     |      Args:\r\n     |          config_path: Path to the JSON configuration file (for operating params only)\r\n     |\r\n\u001b[7m--More--\u001b[27m"]
